{"id": "gc-gene-c11ba408", "d": "add", "leaf": "M2B.5.4/1", "page": "5:118:1", "mcq": {"s": "Which of the following would lead to malnutrition?\n1. Overnutrition\n2. Undernutrition\n3. Imbalanced nutrition\nSelect the correct answer using the code given below:", "o": ["2 alone", "2 and 3", "1 and 3", "1, 2 and 3"], "a": 3, "x": "Malnutrition covers both too little and too much of nutrients: undernutrition, overnutrition (overweight, obesity) and imbalanced diets all cause it.", "src": "UPSC CSE (Pre) 1996"}}
